  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guzar Solar and Battery Energy Storage Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves the design, construction, and operation of a 300 MW solar PV power plant, 75

MWh BESS, and their associated infrastructure in the Guzar district of Kashkadarya region of

Uzbekistan . This combination of solar energy and storage will provide clean energy

and improve power reliability in Uzbekistan by storing excess power during high production and

releasing it during peak demand.</narrative>
  </description>
